    "importInstructions": "Import p4-final-gtm-hiring-signal.json into n8n, then re-link 8 credentials by name: tavily bearer (HTTP Bearer), OpenRouter account, Hunter account, Prospeo account, Dropcontact account, ZeroBounce account, HubSpot Service Key account (HubSpot App Token), GTM Hiring Signals Slack (Slack OAuth). Webhook path gtm-hiring-signal-v3. See docs/runbook.md + docs/credentials.md. HubSpot portal 247212224 must have 11 custom contact properties pre-provisioned.",
