    "liveVerification": "exec patterns: WorkOS/Tavily+GTO→Hunter→Prospeo→ZeroBounce valid → HubSpot upsert + Slack Block Kit #all-fafo. Quarantine gates verified for no_intent / no_person / invalid_email."
